WrapNativeTest
├── when amount is max uint256
│   ├── when adapter has zero native balance
│   │   └── it should revert
│   └── when adapter has native balance
│       ├── when receiver is this adapter
│       │   └── it should wrap and keep tokens in adapter
│       └── when receiver is not this adapter
│           └── it should wrap and transfer tokens to receiver
└── when amount is not max uint256
    ├── when amount is zero
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when amount is greater than zero
        ├── when receiver is this adapter
        │   └── it should wrap specified amount and keep tokens in adapter
        └── when receiver is not this adapter
            └── it should wrap specified amount and transfer tokens to receiver 